00:20:17.855 --> 00:20:19.920
- Mediums can be a very controversial idea

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.070
for a lot of people, and I think

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.430
having a first-hand experience

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.496
can be essential to really understand it,

00:20:24.496 --> 00:20:26.466
but I hope that if anybody
gets anything out of this,

00:20:26.466 --> 00:20:28.390
whether they're watching
the show, Hollywood Medium,

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.910
or watching readings like
this, that people see,

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.232
celebrity or not, that there's
very special connections

00:20:33.232 --> 00:20:35.203
that can be made,
validations that show that

00:20:35.203 --> 00:20:39.010
we're all connected to each
other, and that's important.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.915
- Whether they're alive,
or they've passed away,

00:20:41.915 --> 00:20:45.208
just surround yourself with loving people,

00:20:45.208 --> 00:20:46.875
and hold them close.

00:20:49.436 --> 00:20:51.246
- My ancestors don't look
like the ones in Mulan do.

00:20:51.246 --> 00:20:52.831
(Tyler laughs)

00:20:52.831 --> 00:20:54.059
- Definitely not.
- Damn!

00:20:54.059 --> 00:20:55.948
I wanted him to just turn and be like,

00:20:55.948 --> 00:20:58.588
"Great stone dragon, have you awakened?"

00:20:58.588 --> 00:21:01.381
Man, I would've fucking came in my pants

00:21:01.381 --> 00:21:02.951
if he had said that.

00:21:02.951 --> 00:21:05.368
"I'm the great stone dragon!"

00:21:06.454 --> 00:21:08.058
I would make a great medium.

00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:09.013
